 structure and biophysical properties of surfactant</article-title><source>J Appl Physiol</source><year>2002</year><volume>92</volume><fpage>1169</fpage><lpage>1175</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">11842055</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B23"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Tschumperlin</surname><given-names>DJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Margulies</surname><given-names>SS</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Alveolar epithelial surface area&#x02013;volume relationship in isolated rat lungs</article-title><source>J Appl Physiol</source><year>1999</year><volume>86</volume><fpage>2026</fpage><lpage>2033</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">10368370</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B24"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Bouvet</surname><given-names>F</given-names></name><name><surname>Dreyfuss</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name><name><surname>Lebtahi</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Martet</surname><given-names>G</given-names></name><name><surname>Le Guludec</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name><name><surname>Saumon</surname><given-names>G</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Noninvasive evaluation of acute capillary permeability changes during high-volume ventilation in rats with and without hypercapnic acidosis</article-title><source>Crit Care Med</source><year>2005</year><volume>33</volume><fpage>155</fpage><lpage>160</lpage><comment>discussion 250&#x02013;252</comment><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15644663</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1097/01.CCM.0000150657.02138.29</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B25"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Seeger</surname><given-names>W</given-names></name><name><surname>Stohr</surname><given-names>G</given-names></name><name><surname>Wolf</surname><given-names>HR</given-names></name><n